    "question": "In an ideal gas cycle, $1000\\text{ J}$ of heat is absorbed at high temperature, $400\\text{ J}$ of heat is rejected at low temperature, and $200\\text{ J}$ of heat is lost through casing. The thermal efficiency of the cycle is:",
